Third-party data

data/tickets.json is derived from the Bitext Customer Support LLM Chatbot
Training Dataset, (c) Bitext Innovations, 2024.
https://huggingface.co/datasets/bitext/Bitext-customer-support-llm-chatbot-training-dataset

Changes from the original: each ticket's body is the dataset's customer message
(the "instruction" column) with {{placeholders}} replaced by sample values, and
its subject is a short summary of the dataset's intent. The dataset's agent
responses are not included.

